// mode: 'overview' (grouped preview across every permitted module) | 'deep' (one module, paginated)
// scope: 'context' (pinned to contextModule) | 'everywhere' — the top-level toggle shown
// when search was opened from a page with a known module (see PAGE_TO_SEARCH_MODULE).
// contextModule/returnPage are set once when search opens and read by the scope toggle
// and the Escape shortcut; lastResults caches the most recent response for the
// read-only overlay fallback (_openSearchResultOverlay) to look a clicked row up by id.
